264 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Attention is a mechanism used in machine learning, particularly in deep learning models, to determine the relative importance of different parts of the input data. It allows the model to focus on specific parts of the input when making predictions, rather than treating all parts equally.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
