/E (4.  Weighted Sum : Multiply these attention weights by the corresponding Value vectors to compute the final output. This step aggregates the values based on their relevance.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (   - Output = Attention Weights * V)
/Pg 20 0 R
